WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.916
Welcome to Downtown, where you build the foundation for your US operations.

2
00:00:03.916 --> 00:00:13.052
The decisions you make here don't just set things up, they lock in your tax structure, affect your visa options, and determine whether U.S. investors can fund you.

3
00:00:13.052 --> 00:00:15.662
Get this right, and everything else gets easier.

4
00:00:15.662 --> 00:00:18.273
Get it wrong, and it's expensive to fix.

5
00:00:18.273 --> 00:00:27.083
In this module, you'll make four critical decisions: Choose the right entity, LLC or C-Corp, and understand why an S-Corp usually isn't an option for international founders.

6
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:30.346
Register your business in Florida through Florida Division of Corporations.

7
00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:33.283
Set up a registered agent and obtain your EIN.

8
00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:37.198
Prepare what you actually need to open a U.S. business bank account.

9
00:00:37.198 --> 00:00:42.419
One key point: use the entity decision guide before you speak with an attorney, not after.

10
00:00:42.419 --> 00:00:46.335
It will help you ask the right questions and avoid costly mistakes.

11
00:00:46.335 --> 00:00:47.640
Let's get to work.
